            "level": {
              "value": 16
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You seek to excise the rot from the Gravelands and have made progress to do so. You can cast field of life as a 6th-rank halcyon spell, and you gain a 6th-rank halcyon spell slot. When you cast your halcyon field of life as a primal spell, any living creatures in the area when you Sustain the spell gain a +2 status bonus to saving throws against curses, diseases, and poisons for 1 round."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
